2. What you may do

Univera grants you a worldwide, nonexclusive, royalty-free permission to read,
run, copy, fork, modify and display Project Material for noncommercial purposes;
to make physical items from the original or modified designs for those purposes;
and to share files, modifications and physical items free of charge. You may,
for example, print a case for your own Mac, improve its design, publish a free
fork, or give a printed part to a friend.

Keep this license, the copyright and attribution notices and the applicable
third-party notices with copies you share. Identify your modifications and do
