Buying filament or paying an ordinary fee to use equipment you operate
yourself is permitted for a personal noncommercial print. Paying someone else
to make the part for you is not covered. A free download or giveaway used to
promote a commercial case or service is not a noncommercial use.

Univera reserves the ability to make commercial use of its own material and
